**After newling's review.** With the empty-output fix, at stack tip
6296886715 (ROCm 10.2, before the rebase onto develop), the same filter
ran 501 tests on gfx90a, 544 on gfx942 and 564 on gfx950, with 0
failures. newling's conjugate-transpose case failed 10 of its 18 cases
before the fix (all those with a C operand) and passed all 18 after, on
gfx1201 with ROCm 7.1. On the current tip (86d4ac308c, with both fixes,
rebased onto develop with #13119), the full fast_check filter on gfx942
(MI300X) ran 561 tests: 495 passed, 66 skipped for a stated reason, and
none failed, including all 18 conjugate-transpose cases and 28 fp8 fnuz
